    "fallthrough": "nuxt-ui components render their root through reka-ui's Primitive (a dynamic `as` element), and the runtime never uses its native-root components (prose, ChatMessages, editor menus) itself, so Vize, like vue-tsc, has no root element type to check an undeclared attribute against.",
